-- title:
--   Original infinite-cap stopped compact HJB drift is L1 with nonpositive expectation
-- statement:
--   For the exact original infinite-cap spectrally negative Levy process, right-payment reserve and ruin indicator, the source compact HJB generator drift integrated up to any right-continuous stopping time over a finite physical horizon is integrable and has nonpositive expectation. This uses the accepted original stopped-clock L1 transport and the pointwise HJB inequality.
-- source:
